# Absolute vorticity (10^-5 s^-1, display units after A*1e5). Classic
# 500mb chart look: transparent near zero, yellow -> orange -> red ->
# magenta for cyclonic maxima; faint gray for anticyclonic (negative).
nv    0   0   0   0
-10   180 180 190 120
0     255 255 255 0
8     250 245 160 90
14    250 220 90  150
20    250 170 60  200
28    240 110 45  235
38    220 55  35  250
50    170 30  110 255
